  "description": "Your biggest fan since day one.\n\nHanul has always been Sanso's biggest supporter. But as Sanso gets closer to his dream of becoming a singer, they begin to drift apart. Four years later, Hanul has a boyfriend, and Sanso is in a popular idol group. Somehow, fate brings them together again. Will they share how they really feel this time?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue and 6 extras.*",
